<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="home-hero">
  <div class="reveal reveal-left">
    <h1>Fire your boss.<br><span class="accent-text">Level up instead.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-left:0">NoBossly turns starting a business into a game you play in real life. Draw your Founder Compass, choose your own idea, and climb ten levels — where every level-up is a real achievement: first feedback, first sale, first $1k month. The XP is for fun. The accomplishments are real.</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:flex-start">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/signup">Press start — it's free →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/sample-compass">See a real Compass first</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <img class="hero-img img-fade" src="https://pub-95ede4ca0cce4b26aa322170b1a5b9f1.r2.dev/Site%20Images/light-bulb_p2diod.png" alt="Your business idea, lit up">
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee-track">
    <span>A game you play in real life ✦ Draw your Founder Compass ✦ Choose your own idea ✦ First sale = Level 5 ✦ Quests, not busywork ✦ Cohort challenges ✦ Daily streaks ✦ Level 8 unlocks the accelerator track ✦ Become the Legend ✦&nbsp;</span><span>A game you play in real life ✦ Draw your Founder Compass ✦ Choose your own idea ✦ First sale = Level 5 ✦ Quests, not busywork ✦ Cohort challenges ✦ Daily streaks ✦ Level 8 unlocks the accelerator track ✦ Become the Legend ✦&nbsp;</span>
  </div>
</div>

<%# Guarded: the homepage is the last page that should 500 because a route
    forgot a local. Missing paths means the section is skipped, not a blank page. %>
<% if (typeof paths !== 'undefined' && paths && paths.length) { %>
<section class="reveal reveal-up" id="paths">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div>
      <h2>Pick your path first</h2>
      <p class="muted">A plumber and a podcaster do not need the same advice, so they do not get the same questions. Your path changes what you are asked, the fit test your idea is held to, and the quests you get.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/paths">Compare all paths →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="home-paths">
    <% paths.forEach(function (p) { %>
      <a class="home-path" href="/paths/<%= p.slug %>">
        <span class="hp-emoji"><%= p.emoji %></span>
        <strong><%= p.label %></strong>
      </a>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
  <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:.7rem">The ten-level ladder is the same for everyone. A first sale is a first sale.</p>
</section>
<% } %>

<style>
  .home-paths { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(10rem, 1fr)); gap: .6rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .home-path {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);
    background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: .8rem .9rem;
  }
  .home-path:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .hp-emoji { font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1; flex: none; }
  .home-path strong { font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.2; }
</style>

<section class="stats-band reveal reveal-up">
  <div class="card stat">
    <div class="stat-circle" data-pct="55">
      <svg width="130" height="130"><circle class="ring-bg" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle><circle class="ring" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle></svg>
      <span class="pct">0%</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">of American adults have thought about starting a business</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card stat">
    <div class="stat-circle" data-pct="15">
      <svg width="130" height="130"><circle class="ring-bg" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle><circle class="ring" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle></svg>
      <span class="pct">0%</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">have taken a concrete step — like writing a plan or registering a company</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card stat">
    <div class="stat-circle" data-pct="37">
      <svg width="130" height="130"><circle class="ring-bg" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle><circle class="ring" cx="65" cy="65" r="54"></circle></svg>
      <span class="pct">0%</span>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">of would-be founders this year have done anything beyond basic research</p>
  </div>
  <p class="stats-kicker muted small">Thinking about it is Level 0. NoBossly is how you start playing.</p>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-right">
  <div>
    <h2>🧭 Roll your character: the Founder Compass</h2>
    <p class="muted">Every game starts with a character sheet. Ours is drawn from you — a deep questionnaire becomes your founder archetype, your loadout of strengths and unfair advantages, the territories where you have a real edge, and a 5-point fit test built from your own constraints. Then the twist: <strong>you</strong> choose the idea. Your AI advisor stress-tests it against your own fit test and the live market — where it holds, where it strains, and the sharper wedge — but the call is always yours.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>Your archetype, loadout &amp; binding constraints — read back honestly</li>
      <li>Territories worth exploring, with live market temperature</li>
      <li>An avoid list: what's tempting but wrong for you</li>
      <li>Draft YOUR idea — the advisor sharpens it, you decide</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row reveal reveal-left">
  <div>
    <h2>🎮 Climb the Founder's Ladder</h2>
    <p class="muted">Ten levels. XP and daily streaks pace you, but no rung can be bought with points — every level gates on a real-world quest. AI-planned 7-day sprints and daily check-ins move you rung to rung, and your wins post to a public wall with witnesses.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>🔍 Level 2 — Explorer: idea validated, 3 real humans gave feedback</li>
      <li>🔨 Level 3 — Builder: you shipped something into the world</li>
      <li>⚙️ Level 5 — Operator: <strong>first sale.</strong> Real business, real customer, real money</li>
      <li>🎯 Level 8 — Launcher: a $1k month + pitch deck unlocks the accelerator track</li>
      <li>👑 Level 10 — Legend: sustained revenue, your playbook published for the founders behind you</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <img class="img-corner-fade" src="https://pub-95ede4ca0cce4b26aa322170b1a5b9f1.r2.dev/Site%20Images/light-bulb_2_mns1wm.png" alt="The Founder's Ladder" loading="lazy">
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-right">
  <div>
    <h2>🌐 Multiplayer, not solo mode</h2>
    <p class="muted">Quests are harder alone. Cohort challenges start everyone on the same day with one deadline and one leaderboard, the community forum gives you feedback between rungs, and the Wins wall keeps score in public — first dollars, first customers, resignation letters.</p>
    <ul class="feature-list">
      <li>🚩 Cohort challenges — one start date, one deadline, one leaderboard</li>
      <li>🏆 The Wins wall — real achievements from real members, witnessed</li>
      <li>Daily streaks with a monthly freeze — one busy Tuesday won't reset you</li>
      <li>Playing alongside an accelerator? The Ladder is your scoreboard</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-row single reveal reveal-left">
  <div>
    <h2>📚 The founder library, free and open</h2>
    <p class="muted">Over a hundred practical guides — registering the business, pricing your first offer, finding customers where you actually live — free to read, no account needed. Start there while you decide whether the game is for you.</p>
    <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:.9rem">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/guides">Browse the guides</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/locations">Guides by location</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band reveal reveal-up">
  <h2>Your boss isn't going to fire themselves.</h2>
  <p class="muted">Join free, answer seven questions, and start the climb. Level 5 is a real customer paying you real money — and it's closer than you think.</p>
  <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="margin-top:1.1rem;display:inline-block" href="/signup">Draw my Founder Compass →</a>
</section>
<script src="/js/home.js?v=5"></script>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
